OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder over fatal
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter another man was found dead at a
OL,8,Fproperty in Birmingham.
OL,10,FAtiqullah Niazai, 26, was discovered
OL,11,Fwith stab wounds at an address on Long
OL,12,FStreet, Sparkbrook on 28 August, West
OL,13,FMidlands Police said.
OL,15,FMe'Schach Crichton, 28, from
OL,16,FBirmingham, was charged with murder and
OL,17,Fappeared before the city's magistrates'
OL,18,Fcourt on Tuesday.
OL,20,FHe was remanded into custody ahead of
OL,21,Fan appearance at Birmingham Crown Court
OL,22,Fon Thursday.
